#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:115
msgid "Utilities for managing, converting, and organizing your ROM collection"
msgstr "Utilitas untuk mengelola, mengonversi, dan mengatur koleksi ROM Anda"

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:35 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:128
#: templates/rom_tools_settings.html:298
msgid "Archive Scanner"
msgstr "Pemindai Arsip"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:131
msgid ""
"Scan ROM archives for corruption, unwanted files, and multi-file disc "
"images. Clean up and create M3U playlists automatically."
msgstr ""
"Pindai arsip ROM untuk mendeteksi kerusakan, berkas yang tidak "
"diinginkan, dan image disc multi-berkas. Bersihkan dan buat playlist M3U "
"secara otomatis."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:135
msgid "Tools available"
msgstr "Alat tersedia"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:137
msgid "Requires 7z or unzip"
msgstr "Memerlukan 7z atau unzip"

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:36 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:145
msgid "CHD Converter"
msgstr "Konverter CHD"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:148
msgid ""
"Convert disc images (ISO, CUE/BIN, GDI) to compressed CHD format. Save "
"significant storage space while maintaining full compatibility."
msgstr ""
"Konversi image disc (ISO, CUE/BIN, GDI) ke format CHD terkompresi. Hemat "
"ruang penyimpanan secara signifikan sambil tetap mempertahankan "
"kompatibilitas penuh."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:152 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:169
msgid "chdman available"
msgstr "chdman tersedia"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:154 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:171
msgid "Requires chdman (MAME tools)"
msgstr "Memerlukan chdman (MAME tools)"

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:37 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:162
msgid "CHD Verify"
msgstr "Verifikasi CHD"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:165
msgid ""
"Verify the integrity of your CHD files to detect corruption. Ensure your "
"compressed disc images are valid and playable."
msgstr ""
"Verifikasi integritas berkas CHD Anda untuk mendeteksi kerusakan. "
"Pastikan image disc terkompresi Anda valid dan dapat dimainkan."

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:39 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:179
msgid "Duplicate Finder"
msgstr "Pencari Duplikat"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:182
msgid ""
"Find duplicate ROMs by hash, filename, or both. Identify wasted storage "
"from region variants and redundant copies."
msgstr ""
"Temukan ROM duplikat berdasarkan hash, nama berkas, atau keduanya. "
"Identifikasi penyimpanan yang terbuang dari varian wilayah dan salinan "
"yang berlebihan."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:185 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:199
#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:226 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:239
#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:253 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:267
#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:280 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:294
#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:334 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:347
#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:375 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:388
#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:401
msgid "No dependencies required"
msgstr "Tidak memerlukan dependensi"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:196
msgid ""
"Link the same game from different regions so the Library shows it once. "
"Review the groups RetroDB suggests, or link versions by hand on a game "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Tautkan game yang sama dari wilayah berbeda agar Pustaka menampilkannya "
"sekali. Tinjau grup yang disarankan RetroDB, atau tautkan versi secara "
"manual di halaman game."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:209
msgid ""
"Fill the empty fields of a whole system with AI, choosing which fields, "
"the game's official name among them."
msgstr ""
"Isi kolom kosong satu sistem penuh dengan AI, dengan memilih kolom mana "
"saja, termasuk nama resmi game."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:212
msgid "Needs an AI provider (Settings > Scraping)"
msgstr "Memerlukan penyedia AI (Pengaturan > Scraping)"

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:38 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:220
msgid "Multi-Disc Organizer"
msgstr "Pengatur Multi-Disc"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:223
msgid ""
"Organize multi-disc games into proper folder structures and generate M3U "
"playlists for seamless disc-swapping in emulators."
msgstr ""
"Atur game multi-disc ke dalam struktur folder yang tepat dan buat "
"playlist M3U untuk pergantian disc yang mulus di emulator."

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:43 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:233
msgid "Screenshot Dedup"
msgstr "Dedup Screenshot"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:236
msgid ""
"Find and remove duplicate screenshots per game using exact file hash or "
"visual similarity matching. Free up storage and clean up your media "
"library."
msgstr ""
"Temukan dan hapus screenshot duplikat per game menggunakan hash berkas "
"persis atau pencocokan kemiripan visual. Bebaskan ruang penyimpanan dan "
"bersihkan pustaka media Anda."

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:44 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:247
#: templates/screenshot_review.html:5 templates/screenshot_review.html:64
msgid "Screenshot Review"
msgstr "Tinjauan Screenshot"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:250
msgid ""
"Find screenshots that may show another system’s version of a game. ZX "
"Spectrum, Commodore 64 and Game Boy shots are listed with the most "
"suspicious first, and you decide what to remove."
msgstr ""
"Temukan screenshot yang mungkin menampilkan game versi sistem lain. "
"Screenshot ZX Spectrum, Commodore 64, dan Game Boy diurutkan dari yang "
"paling mencurigakan, dan Anda yang memutuskan mana yang dihapus."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:274 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:728
msgid "Image Resizer"
msgstr "Pengubah Ukuran Gambar"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:277
msgid ""
"Standardize all images to consistent sizes using AI upscaling (Real-"
"ESRGAN) for small images and Lanczos downscaling for large ones. Targets "
"1080px height for boxart/screenshots and 1280px longest edge for "
"controllers/hardware."
msgstr ""
"Standarkan semua gambar ke ukuran yang konsisten menggunakan upscaling AI"
" (Real-ESRGAN) untuk gambar kecil dan downscaling Lanczos untuk gambar "
"besar. Target tinggi 1080px untuk boxart/screenshot dan sisi terpanjang "
"1280px untuk kontroler/perangkat keras."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:288 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:701
#, fuzzy
msgid "Build 3D Boxes"
msgstr "Boks 3D"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:291
msgid ""
"Builds a turning 3D box, on the real case for its console, for every "
"scraped game with a cover. A scrape now does this by itself; this is for "
"games scraped before. A box imported from Slipcase is never changed."
msgstr ""

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:302 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:448
msgid "Backfill Alternate Titles"
msgstr "Isi Ulang Judul Alternatif"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:305
msgid ""
"Scan your library for regional / alternate game titles (e.g. "
"&ldquo;Action in New York&rdquo; = &ldquo;S.C.A.T.&rdquo; = &ldquo;Final "
"Mission&rdquo;) without re-scraping media. Uses the same IGDB and "
"ScreenScraper search results that would fire during a scrape, just "
"extracting the alt names."
msgstr ""
"Pindai pustaka Anda untuk judul game regional / alternatif (mis. "
"&ldquo;Action in New York&rdquo; = &ldquo;S.C.A.T.&rdquo; = &ldquo;Final "
"Mission&rdquo;) tanpa scrape ulang media. Menggunakan hasil pencarian "
"IGDB dan ScreenScraper yang sama seperti saat scrape, hanya mengekstrak "
"nama alternatifnya."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:308
msgid "Metadata only &middot; no media downloads"
msgstr "Hanya metadata &middot; tanpa unduhan media"

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:45 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:315
#: templates/ss_region_repair.html:5 templates/ss_region_repair.html:98
#: templates/ss_region_repair.html:117 templates/ss_region_repair.html:139
msgid "Fix Box and Manual Regions"
msgstr "Perbaiki Wilayah Box dan Manual"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:318 templates/ss_region_repair.html:99
msgid ""
"Older ScreenScraper scrapes could give a game another region's box or "
"manual, such as a European box on a USA game. This looks each one up "
"again and swaps it for the right region. Pictures from anywhere else are "
"left alone."
msgstr ""
"Scrape ScreenScraper versi lama bisa memberi game box atau manual dari "
"wilayah lain, misalnya box Eropa untuk game USA. Fitur ini mencari ulang "
"setiap game dan menggantinya dengan wilayah yang tepat. Gambar dari "
"sumber lain tidak diubah."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:321 templates/ss_region_repair.html:106
msgid "Needs a ScreenScraper account"
msgstr "Perlu akun ScreenScraper"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:328 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:475
msgid "Fix Regions from File Names"
msgstr "Perbaiki Wilayah dari Nama File"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:331
msgid ""
"The AI used to guess a game's region even when its file name said, so a "
"(USA) file could be listed as Japan. This gives those games the region in"
" their file name."
msgstr ""
"AI dulu menebak wilayah game meskipun nama filenya sudah menyebutkan, "
"sehingga file (USA) bisa tercatat sebagai Jepang. Fitur ini memberi game "
"tersebut wilayah sesuai nama filenya."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:341 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:509
msgid "Tidy Genres, Perspectives and Modes"
msgstr "Rapikan Genre, Perspektif, dan Mode"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:344
msgid ""
"Sources name the same thing differently, so one genre could appear as "
"both RPG and Role Playing Game, and a filter missed games. This gives "
"every game one set of names."
msgstr ""
"Setiap sumber menamai hal yang sama dengan cara berbeda, jadi satu genre "
"bisa muncul sebagai RPG dan Role Playing Game, sehingga filter melewatkan"
" beberapa game. Fitur ini memberi setiap game satu set nama yang seragam."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:358
msgid ""
"Gives MAME games their real names, years and makers from MAME's own list,"
" and leaves the files alone."
msgstr ""
"Memberi game MAME nama asli, tahun, dan pembuatnya dari daftar resmi "
"MAME, tanpa mengubah file."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:361
msgid "Needs a MAME list file"
msgstr "Perlu file daftar MAME"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:369 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:543
msgid "Tidy Release Dates"
msgstr "Rapikan Tanggal Rilis"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:372
msgid ""
"Older scrapes stored a date known only by its year as 1 January or 31 "
"December, as if the day were known. This cuts those dates back to the "
"year or month, so a scrape can fill in the real one."
msgstr ""
"Scrape lama menyimpan tanggal yang hanya diketahui tahunnya sebagai 1 "
"Januari atau 31 Desember, seolah harinya diketahui. Fitur ini memangkas "
"tanggal tersebut menjadi tahun atau bulan saja, sehingga scrape dapat "
"mengisi tanggal yang sebenarnya."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:382 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:577
msgid "Check Saved Play Times"
msgstr "Periksa Waktu Bermain Tersimpan"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:385
msgid ""
"Older lookups could save the play time of a sequel, or of another game "
"with the same name on another system. This sends those matches to the "
"review page, where you keep or clear each one."
msgstr ""
"Pencarian lama bisa menyimpan waktu bermain dari sekuel, atau dari Game "
"lain dengan nama sama di Sistem lain. Ini mengirim kecocokan tersebut ke "
"halaman tinjauan, tempat Anda menyimpan atau menghapus tiap waktu."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:395 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:611
msgid "Clear RAWG Pictures from Box Art"
msgstr "Hapus Gambar RAWG dari Sampul"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:398
msgid ""
"RAWG has no box art, so older scrapes saved a background picture or "
"screenshot as the cover, and that blocks a real cover. This clears those "
"pictures so a scrape can find real covers."
msgstr ""
"RAWG tidak punya sampul, jadi scrape lama menyimpan gambar latar atau "
"screenshot sebagai sampul, dan itu menghalangi sampul asli. Fitur ini "
"menghapus gambar tersebut agar scrape bisa menemukan sampul asli."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:408 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:649
msgid "Bulk HLTB Lookup"
msgstr "Pencarian HLTB Massal"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:411
msgid ""
"Fetch HowLongToBeat playtime for every game. High-confidence primary-"
"title matches apply automatically; alt-title matches and low-confidence "
"hits are queued for review so you can approve or reject in bulk."
msgstr ""
"Ambil waktu bermain HowLongToBeat untuk setiap game. Kecocokan judul "
"utama dengan keyakinan tinggi diterapkan otomatis; kecocokan judul "
"alternatif dan hasil dengan keyakinan rendah diantrekan untuk ditinjau "
"agar Anda dapat menyetujui atau menolak secara massal."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:414
msgid "Uses stored alternate titles"
msgstr "Menggunakan judul alternatif yang tersimpan"

#: templates/_macros/nav_tabs.html:47 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:421
msgid "HLTB Pending Review"
msgstr "HLTB Menunggu Tinjauan"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:424
msgid ""
"Review and approve HLTB matches that were flagged during a bulk lookup "
"&mdash; alt-title matches and anything below the confidence threshold."
msgstr ""
"Tinjau dan setujui kecocokan HLTB yang ditandai selama pencarian massal "
"&mdash; kecocokan judul alternatif dan apa pun di bawah ambang batas "
"keyakinan."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:427
msgid "Requires review"
msgstr "Memerlukan tinjauan"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:434
msgid "Tool Settings"
msgstr "Pengaturan Alat"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:437
msgid ""
"Configure paths, external tool locations, archive types, and other "
"preferences shared across all ROM tools."
msgstr ""
"Konfigurasikan jalur, lokasi alat eksternal, jenis arsip, dan preferensi "
"lain yang digunakan bersama di semua alat ROM."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:449
msgid ""
"Scan every scraped game for alternate / regional titles using IGDB and "
"ScreenScraper search results.\n"
"\n"
"No media is downloaded, no other metadata is touched — just alternate "
"title lists are merged into the DB.\n"
"\n"
"This may take a while for large libraries."
msgstr ""
"Pindai semua game yang sudah di-scrape untuk mencari judul "
"alternatif/regional memakai hasil pencarian IGDB dan ScreenScraper.\n"
"\n"
"Tidak ada media yang diunduh dan metadata lain tidak diubah — hanya "
"daftar judul alternatif yang digabungkan ke DB.\n"
"\n"
"Ini bisa memakan waktu untuk pustaka besar."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:459
msgid "Alt-titles backfill started"
msgstr "Pengisian judul alternatif dimulai"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:467 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:668
#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:710 templates/rom_tools_hub.html:721
#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:747
msgid "Failed to start"
msgstr "Gagal memulai"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:470
msgid "Failed to start backfill"
msgstr "Gagal memulai backfill"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:476
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{count} games have a region from the AI that their file name contradicts."
" Each will get the region in its file name.\n"
"\n"
"Only regions the AI filled are changed. If you corrected one of those by "
"hand to differ from the file name, it changes too."
msgstr ""
"{count} game punya wilayah dari AI yang bertentangan dengan nama filenya."
" Masing-masing akan diberi wilayah sesuai nama filenya.\n"
"\n"
"Hanya wilayah yang diisi AI yang diubah. Jika Anda mengoreksinya sendiri "
"hingga berbeda dari nama file, wilayah itu juga ikut berubah."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:477
msgid "No game has an AI region that its file name contradicts."
msgstr "Tidak ada game dengan wilayah AI yang bertentangan dengan nama filenya."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:478
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Fixed {count} regions."
msgstr "{count} wilayah diperbaiki."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:479
msgid "Could not fix the regions"
msgstr "Tidak dapat memperbaiki wilayah"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:510
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{count} games will change.\n"
"\n"
"Names become the ones in the filter lists. Words with no place there, "
"such as Arcade or Indie, are removed. Words that belong elsewhere, such "
"as FPV, move to the right field if it is empty. A player count that "
"contradicts the game's modes is corrected, and old counts of 1 from RAWG "
"are cleared.\n"
"\n"
"Afterwards, run a bulk scrape with Fill Missing to fill anything left "
"empty."
msgstr ""
"{count} game akan berubah.\n"
"\n"
"Nama diganti dengan nama yang ada di daftar filter. Kata yang tidak punya"
" tempat di sana, seperti Arcade atau Indie, dihapus. Kata yang seharusnya"
" ada di bagian lain, seperti FPV, dipindahkan ke kolom yang tepat jika "
"kolom itu kosong. Jumlah pemain yang bertentangan dengan mode game "
"diperbaiki, dan jumlah lama bernilai 1 dari RAWG dihapus.\n"
"\n"
"Setelahnya, jalankan scrape massal dengan Isi yang Kosong untuk mengisi "
"data yang masih kosong."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:511
msgid "Every game already uses these names."
msgstr "Semua game sudah memakai nama-nama ini."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:512
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Tidied {count} games. Run a bulk scrape with Fill Missing to fill "
"anything left empty."
msgstr ""
"{count} game telah dirapikan. Jalankan scrape massal dengan Isi yang "
"Kosong untuk mengisi data yang masih kosong."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:513
msgid "Could not tidy the names"
msgstr "Tidak dapat merapikan nama"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:544
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{count} games will change.\n"
"\n"
"A date such as 1 January 1987 becomes 1987. A date no scrape filled stays"
" as it is."
msgstr ""
"{count} game akan berubah.\n"
"\n"
"Tanggal seperti 1 Januari 1987 menjadi 1987. Tanggal yang tidak diisi "
"oleh scrape mana pun tetap seperti semula."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:545
msgid "No release dates need tidying."
msgstr "Tidak ada tanggal rilis yang perlu dirapikan."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:546
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Tidied {count} games. Run a bulk scrape with Fill Missing to look for "
"fuller dates."
msgstr ""
"{count} game telah dirapikan. Jalankan scrape massal dengan Isi yang "
"Kosong untuk mencari tanggal yang lebih lengkap."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:547
msgid "Could not tidy the release dates"
msgstr "Tidak dapat merapikan tanggal rilis"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:578
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{count} saved play times look like another game. They will go to the "
"review page, and no game changes until you decide.\n"
"\n"
"There, Approve keeps a time and Reject clears it."
msgstr ""
"{count} waktu bermain tersimpan tampak seperti milik Game lain. Waktu itu"
" akan masuk ke halaman tinjauan, dan tidak ada Game yang berubah sampai "
"Anda memutuskan.\n"
"\n"
"Di sana, Setujui menyimpan waktu dan Tolak menghapusnya."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:579
msgid "No saved play time looks wrong."
msgstr "Tidak ada waktu bermain tersimpan yang tampak salah."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:580
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Sent {count} play times to the HowLongToBeat review page."
msgstr "{count} waktu bermain dikirim ke halaman tinjauan HowLongToBeat."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:581
msgid "Could not check the saved play times"
msgstr "Tidak bisa memeriksa waktu bermain tersimpan"

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:612
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{count} games and wishlist items use a RAWG picture as their box art. "
"Those pictures will be deleted, and these games show no cover until a "
"scrape finds one.\n"
"\n"
"Covers from other sources and all fanart stay. Afterwards, run a bulk "
"scrape with Fill Missing to look for real covers."
msgstr ""
"{count} game dan item wishlist memakai gambar RAWG sebagai sampulnya. "
"Gambar tersebut akan dihapus, dan game ini tidak punya sampul sampai "
"scrape menemukannya.\n"
"\n"
"Sampul dari sumber lain dan semua fanart tetap ada. Setelah itu, jalankan"
" scrape massal dengan Fill Missing untuk mencari sampul asli."

#: templates/rom_tools_hub.html:613
