#: templates/_settings_tabs/scraping.html:340
msgid ""
"Each person can add their own in Settings > Account > My Profile, and "
"theirs is used first. The household's here is used only for an admin who "
"has not added their own, so no one's games land in another person's "
"library."
msgstr ""
"Setiap orang bisa menambahkan kunci sendiri di Pengaturan > Akun > Profil"
" Saya, dan kunci mereka dipakai lebih dulu. Kunci rumah tangga di sini "
"hanya dipakai untuk admin yang belum menambahkan kunci sendiri, sehingga "
"game siapa pun tidak masuk ke pustaka orang lain."

#: templates/_settings_tabs/scraping.html:351
